Package: highdir
Title: Backend-Agnostic Figure Builder for Highcharter and ggplot2
Version: 0.3.1
Authors@R:
  person(
    given = "Yusman",
    family = "Kamaleri",
    email = "ybkamaleri@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"),
    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-5014-3665")
  )
Description: Provides a unified, backend-agnostic API for building interactive
    figures with 'highcharter' or static figures with 'ggplot2'. A figure is
    described once via a spec object and rendered to either backend without
    changing the calling code. Includes a Norwegian health-survey colour palette,
    flexible theme/style configuration, optional JavaScript injection for hover
    effects and accessibility, and both standalone save helpers and a Shiny GUI.
URL: https://folkehelsestats.github.io/highdir/, https://github.com/folkehelsestats/highdir
BugReports: https://github.com/folkehelsestats/highdir/issues
